implicit_pod_assignment_call (cpp_typecheck_expr.cpp) rewrites
`C::operator=(x)' on a POD base without a declared operator= into the
builtin assignment of the base subobject.  Found by dog-fooding gcc 16's
libstdc++ (std::list).
